usage: wrkslots heartbeat [-h] --agent AGENT --owner-pid PID --expected-generation N slot

Refresh the heartbeat only when the caller, agent, PID, and process start identity still match the recorded owner. Expiry is necessary for reclaim but never sufficient.

positional arguments:
  slot                     active slot name

options:
  -h, --help               show this help message and exit
  --agent AGENT            recorded agent name
  --owner-pid PID          recorded live owner PID
  --expected-generation N  current slot generation
